### ================================================================
### 1. Restaurant — GET
### ================================================================

### 1.1 Get Restaurant By Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 Get Restaurants By Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/user/{{userId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.3 Get Categories By Restaurant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/category
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.4 Get Items By Restaurant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/item
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.5 Get AddOns By Restaurant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/addOn
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.6 Search Nearby Restaurants
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/nearby
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "latitude": 33.5138,
  "longitude": 36.2765,
  "radiusKm": 50
}

### ================================================================
### 2. Restaurant — PATCH
### ================================================================

### 2.1 Approve Restaurant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 Close Restaurant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.3 Open Restaurant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.4 Reject Restaurant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/{{restaurantId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.5 Update Commission Rate
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/commissionReate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "commissionRate": 15.0
}

### 2.6 Update Operating Hours
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/operatingHours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "openingTime": "08:00",
  "closingTime": "23:00"
}

### 2.7 Update Order Limits
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/orderLimits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "minOrderAmount": 20.0,
  "maxOrderAmount": 600.0
}

